      "plan": "# Objective\nProduce FINDINGS.md answering which files under src/ call retryWithBackoff, its default attempts, and which callers override attempts and with what value. Read-only; no source changes.\n\n# Plan\n1. Grep the repository for retryWithBackoff and identify the definition and all references.\n2. Read src/net/retry.js and src/config.js to determine the default attempts.\n3. Read each call site to separate real callers from comments and from retryWithBackoffSync, and record attempts overrides.\n4. Write FINDINGS.md ending with exactly one fenced json block in the required shape.\n\n# Acceptance criteria\n- FINDINGS.md lists every src/ file calling retryWithBackoff with repo-root-relative paths.\n- FINDINGS.md states the default attempts.\n- FINDINGS.md identifies each caller overriding attempts and the value.\n- FINDINGS.md ends with one fenced json block of the required shape with valid content.\n- No source file modified; git status shows only added FINDINGS.md.",
